Hi <%= @order.user.name %>,

Thank you for your order #<%= @order.id %>!

Order Date: <%= @order.order_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
Province: <%= @order.province.name %>

Items:
<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.product.name %> x<%= item.quantity %> = <%= number_to_currency(item.price_at_purchase * item.quantity) %>
<% end %>

Subtotal: <%= number_to_currency(@subtotal) %>
Tax: <%= number_to_currency(@tax) %>
Total: <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_amount) %>

Thank you for shopping with Prairie Tech Market!
Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada
